{
  "id": "geo-solids",
  "chapterNumber": "8",
  "title": {
    "en": "Area, Surface Area &amp; Volume",
    "ar": null
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "The measurement strand: areas of plane figures and the surface areas and volumes of the common solids — prisms, cylinders, cones, pyramids and spheres.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Key formulas",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Rectangle area \\( =bh \\); triangle \\( =\\tfrac12 bh \\). Prism volume \\( =A_{\\text{base}}\\times h \\); cylinder \\( =\\pi r^{2}h \\); sphere \\( =\\tfrac43\\pi r^{3} \\); cone \\( =\\tfrac13\\pi r^{2}h \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Rectangle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( A=bh \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Triangle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( A=\\tfrac12 bh \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Prism / cylinder",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( V=A_{\\text{base}}h \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Sphere / cone",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\tfrac43\\pi r^{3},\\ \\tfrac13\\pi r^{2}h \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 8.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the volume of a cube of side \\( 4 \\).</p>\\[ 4^{3}=64. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 8.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the volume of a cylinder with \\( r=2 \\), \\( h=5 \\). Take \\( \\pi=3.14 \\).</p>\\[ \\pi r^{2}h=3.14\\times 4\\times 5=62.8. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
